(26, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2025 English - Item 9 - Question 9</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2025 English - Question 9</strong></p><p>Choose the option that is most nearly opposite in meaning to the underlined word and that will correctly fill the gap in the sentence.</p><p>Jane was <u>loud</u> as a teenager but ______ as an adult.</p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Antonyms', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 16:21:07', NULL, 0, 2025),
