(178, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 3, 0, '<p><small>Source: BECE 2025 English Language - Item 21 - Question 21</small></p><p><strong>BECE 2025 English Language - Question 21</strong></p><p>In each of the following sentences, a group of words has been underlined. Choose from the options A to D, the one that best explains the underlined group of words.</p><p>Aminu is <u>full of himself</u>. This means that Aminu is ........</p>', 'Medium', 'JSS3', '', 'Idioms / Meaning in Context', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 19:08:24', NULL, 0, 2025),
