(180, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 3, 0, '<p><small>Source: BECE 2025 English Language - Item 23 - Question 23</small></p><p><strong>BECE 2025 English Language - Question 23</strong></p><p>In each of the following sentences, a group of words has been underlined. Choose from the options A to D, the one that best explains the underlined group of words.</p><p>On seeing the angry mob approaching the school, our school prefect told us to <u>take to our heels</u>. This means that the prefect told us to ........</p>', 'Medium', 'JSS3', '', 'Idioms / Meaning in Context', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 19:08:24', NULL, 0, 2025),
