(280, 4, 0, 'exam_body', 3, 0, '<p><small>Source: BECE 2024 Integrated Science - Item 3 - Question 3</small></p><p><strong>BECE 2024 Integrated Science - Question 3</strong></p><p>Each question is followed by four options lettered A to D. Choose the correct answer.</p><p>An atom of an element Y has 11 protons and 12 neutrons. What is the number of electrons?</p>', 'Medium', 'JSS3', '', 'Integrated Science', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 23:37:21', NULL, 0, 2024);
