(342, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 25 - Question 25</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 25</strong></p><p>After each of the following sentences, a list of possible interpretations is given. Choose the interpretation that is given. Choose the interpretation that is <strong>most appropriate</strong> for each sentence.<br>The new shopping plaza is easy on the eye. This means that the shopping plaza is</p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Idioms and Interpretation', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:49', NULL, 0, 2024),
