(440, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 123 - Question 123</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 123</strong></p><p><em>In the following options lettered A to D, all the words <strong>except one</strong> have the same stress pattern. Identify the one with the <strong>different stress pattern</strong>.</em></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Stress Pattern', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(441, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 124 - Question 124</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 124</strong></p><p><em>In the following options lettered A to D, all the words <strong>except one</strong> have the same stress pattern. Identify the one with the <strong>different stress pattern</strong>.</em></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Stress Pattern', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(442, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 125 - Question 125</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 125</strong></p><p><em>In the following options lettered A to D, all the words <strong>except one</strong> have the same stress pattern. Identify the one with the <strong>different stress pattern</strong>.</em></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Stress Pattern', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(443, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 126 - Question 126</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 126</strong></p><p><em>In the following options lettered A to D, all the words <strong>except one</strong> have the same stress pattern. Identify the one with the <strong>different stress pattern</strong>.</em></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Stress Pattern', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(444, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 127 - Question 127</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 127</strong></p><p><em>In the following options lettered A to D, all the words <strong>except one</strong> have the same stress pattern. Identify the one with the <strong>different stress pattern</strong>.</em></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Stress Pattern', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(445, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 128 - Question 128</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 128</strong></p><p><em>In each of the following sentences, the word that receives the <strong>emphatic stress</strong> is written in <strong>capital letters.</strong> From the questions lettered A-D, choose the one to which the given sentence is the appropriate answer.</em><br>The United States will host the next FIFA football competition.</p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Emphatic Stress', 'Provisional answer generated from the question text because no official answer key was present in the source file. Verify before approval.', 'draft', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(446, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 129 - Question 129</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 129</strong></p><p><em>In each of the following sentences, the word that receives the <strong>emphatic stress</strong> is written in <strong>capital letters.</strong> From the questions lettered A-D, choose the one to which the given sentence is the appropriate answer.</em><br>Bisi&#39;s mother ENJOYS cooking.</p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Emphatic Stress', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(447, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 130 - Question 130</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 130</strong></p><p><em>In each of the following sentences, the word that receives the <strong>emphatic stress</strong> is written in <strong>capital letters.</strong> From the questions lettered A-D, choose the one to which the given sentence is the appropriate answer.</em><br>We left for MAKURDI yesterday.</p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Emphatic Stress', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(448, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 131 - Question 131</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 131</strong></p><p><em>In each of the following sentences, the word that receives the <strong>emphatic stress</strong> is written in <strong>capital letters.</strong> From the questions lettered A-D, choose the one to which the given sentence is the appropriate answer.</em><br>Ahmed greeted AKIN at the party.</p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Emphatic Stress', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(449, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 132 - Question 132</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 132</strong></p><p><em>In each of the following sentences, the word that receives the <strong>emphatic stress</strong> is written in <strong>capital letters.</strong> From the questions lettered A-D, choose the one to which the given sentence is the appropriate answer.</em><br>Bimpe was the FIRST to submit the assignment.</p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Emphatic Stress', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(450, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 133 - Question 133</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 133</strong></p><p><em>From the words lettered A-D, choose the word that contains the sound represented by the given <strong>phonetic symbol.</strong></em></p><p><strong>/&#652;/</strong></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Phonetics', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(451, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 134 - Question 134</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 134</strong></p><p><em>From the words lettered A-D, choose the word that contains the sound represented by the given <strong>phonetic symbol.</strong></em></p><p><strong>/a&#650;/</strong></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Phonetics', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(452, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 135 - Question 135</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 135</strong></p><p><em>From the words lettered A-D, choose the word that contains the sound represented by the given <strong>phonetic symbol.</strong></em></p><p><strong>/v/</strong></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Phonetics', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(453, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 136 - Question 136</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 136</strong></p><p><em>From the words lettered A-D, choose the word that contains the sound represented by the given <strong>phonetic symbol.</strong></em></p><p><strong>/&#601;/</strong></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Phonetics', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(454, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 137 - Question 137</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 137</strong></p><p><em>From the words lettered A-D, choose the word that contains the sound represented by the given <strong>phonetic symbol.</strong></em></p><p><strong>/&#240;/</strong></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Phonetics', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(455, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 138 - Question 138</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 138</strong></p><p><em>From the words lettered A-D, choose the word that contains the sound represented by the given <strong>phonetic symbol.</strong></em></p><p><strong>/j/</strong></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Phonetics', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(456, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 139 - Question 139</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 139</strong></p><p><em>From the words lettered A-D, choose the word that contains the sound represented by the given <strong>phonetic symbol.</strong></em></p><p><strong>/&#604;&#720;/</strong></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Phonetics', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(457, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 140 - Question 140</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 140</strong></p><p><em>From the words lettered A-D, choose the word that contains the sound represented by the given <strong>phonetic symbol.</strong></em></p><p><strong>/a&#618;/</strong></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Phonetics', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
(458, 2, 0, 'exam_body', 1, 0, '<p><small>Source: WAEC 2024 English - Item 141 - Question 141</small></p><p><strong>WAEC 2024 English - Question 141</strong></p><p><em>From the words lettered A-D, choose the word that contains the sound represented by the given <strong>phonetic symbol.</strong></em></p><p><strong>/i:/</strong></p>', 'Medium', 'SSS3', '', 'Phonetics', '', 'approved', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:12:52', NULL, 0, 2024),
